WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.961
Every change your agents make shows up under Changes.

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:09.496
Review the diff, file by file, before you keep it. And revert anything you don't want.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.985
Test and build with a single click. The results land right in the status bar.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:28.405
And press Dev, to start your dev server and preview the running app, right inside LATYS.
